  "title": "🏡 Spacious 2 Bedroom + 2 Bathroom Townhome in Kitsilano - apartments / housing for rent - craigslist",
  "bodyText": "CL\n\nvancouver, BC >\n\nvancouver >\n\nhousing >\n\napartments / housing for rent\n\npost\naccount\nreply \nfavorite\n \nhide\n \n⚐\nflag\n \n\nshare\n\nPosted a day ago\n\nprint\n$3,600 / 2br - 1200ft2 - 🏡 Spacious 2 Bedroom + 2 Bathroom Townhome in Kitsilano (Kitsilano)\n1855 W 10th Ave, Vancouver, BC V6J2A8\n© craigslist - Map data © OpenStreetMap\n1855 W 10th Ave near Cypress Street\n\ngoogle map\n\n2BR / 2Ba 1200ft2 available now\nrent period: monthly\ncats are OK - purrr\napartment\ndogs are OK - wooof\nw/d in unit\nattached garage\nno smoking\nThis bright and spacious 1,189 sq. ft. one-level townhome offers comfortable living in one of Vancouver’s most desirable neighbourhoods. Located in the heart of Kitsilano, near Arbutus Walk, this well-maintained home is ideal for a family, professionals, or anyone looking to enjoy the best of West Side living.\n\n✨ Features:\n2 spacious bedrooms\n2 full bathrooms\n1,200 sq. ft. of comfortable living space\nUnderground parking included\nBright, windowed kitchen with plenty of oak cabinetry and counter space\nNew Stainless steel appliances\nGenerous eating area\nSpacious living and dining rooms\nCozy gas fireplace\nHardwood floors\nEnclosed deck\nIn-suite laundry\nNew paint throughout\nNew carpet in bedrooms\nNew appliances, including washer and dryer\nBaseboards and crown mouldings throughout\nBeautiful North Shore mountain views\nPet friendly!\n\nNON- Furnished\n\n📍 Prime Kitsilano Location\n\nSituated right on the W 10th Avenue bike route and just half a block from Burrard Street, you'll have easy access to:\n\nShops, restaurants, and cafes along 4th Avenue\nBroadway and Granville Street\nArbutus Walk and nearby parks\nPublic transit virtually at your doorstep\nDowntown Vancouver and UBC\n\nEnjoy the convenience of city living while coming home to a quiet, spacious townhome.\n\n💰 Rental Details:\n\nMonthly Rent: $3,600\nAvailable: Now\nPets: Welcome\nParking: Underground parking included\n\n📩 Interested? Please reply to this posting with a brief introduction, your preferred move-in date, and a little information about yourself and your household. Qualified tenants are welcome to arrange a viewing.\n\n\npost id: 7966716627\n\n \n\nposted: a day ago\n\n \n\nupdated: a day ago\n\n \n\n♥ best of [?]\n\nhelp\nsafety\nprivacy\nterms\nabout\napp\n© 2026 craigslist",
